at the competition.

00:04:04.570 --> 00:04:06.910
We're in the southwest Tokyo region
which includes Shibuya,

00:04:06.910 --> 00:04:09.240
the center of the latest trends.

00:04:09.240 --> 00:04:13.580
Which means that your
assignment will be... this!

00:04:14.870 --> 00:04:15.960
Rap?

00:04:15.960 --> 00:04:18.550
By rap, do you mean...

00:04:18.550 --> 00:04:20.630
Yes, that rap!

00:04:20.630 --> 00:04:24.010
♬ Hey, yo! Each group will be
rapping their way ♬

00:04:24.010 --> 00:04:27.970
♬ into the competition, yo! ♬

00:04:27.970 --> 00:04:30.640
♬ If you don't finish your song in time ♬

00:04:30.640 --> 00:04:34.350
♬ that's gonna be your last rhyme, yo! ♬

00:04:35.350 --> 00:04:38.610
♬ Hey, yo! The name is Kanon Shibuya! ♬

00:04:38.610 --> 00:04:40.030
♬ Though the name's Shibuya ♬

00:04:40.030 --> 00:04:41.990
♬ the Crossing scrambles my brain and... ♬

00:04:41.990 --> 00:04:45.860
I can't... think of what else to say.

00:04:45.860 --> 00:04:48.950
Well, rap's origin is from the streets.

00:04:48.950 --> 00:04:51.660
Then are these the official outfits?

00:04:51.660 --> 00:04:55.750
Chi-<i>chan</i>, you do this! This is different
from singing and it's hard!

00:04:55.750 --> 00:04:56.670
