00:05:51.640 --> 00:05:53.140
♬ Fall, filled with scarlet ♬

00:05:53.140 --> 00:05:54.560
♬ With this song I will present ♬

00:05:54.560 --> 00:05:56.600
♬ Ren Hazuki. ♬

00:05:56.600 --> 00:06:00.440
♬ My feelings still belong to
the 16th night... ♬

00:06:00.440 --> 00:06:01.730
That's a haiku.

00:06:01.730 --> 00:06:02.860
It is actually a <i>tanka</i>!

00:06:02.860 --> 00:06:04.980
