00:06:12.530 --> 00:06:15.500
If Ren-<i>chan </i>can't do it, then Keke-<i>chan</i>!

00:06:15.500 --> 00:06:17.120
♬ Hey, yo! Check it out! ♬

00:06:21.540 --> 00:06:24.090
