00:06:24.090 --> 00:06:26.630
So the only one left is Sumire-<i>chan</i>.

00:06:26.630 --> 00:06:30.140
But she can't! This is our first
assignment towards our precious Love Live!

00:06:30.140 --> 00:06:34.640
We can't leave this up to the one who has
the lowest potential out of all of us...

00:06:35.680 --> 00:06:38.730
♬ Hey, yo! Now that I've
got your attention ♬

00:06:38.730 --> 00:06:41.730
