00:08:08.020 --> 00:08:09.400
But...

00:08:09.400 --> 00:08:12.780
The past is the past.
What's important is what we do now.

00:08:12.780 --> 00:08:16.370
--Yup. We just got our name "Liella!,"
so we can basically start things new.

00:08:16.370 --> 00:08:17.990
