00:08:25.630 --> 00:08:28.000
You better not take
being a school idol lightly!

00:08:28.000 --> 00:08:32.260
I know that. Who do you think I am?
I grew up in show business--

00:08:32.260 --> 00:08:34.880
You're just proving my point!

00:08:34.880 --> 00:08:37.720
This year's Love Live is
going to be a struggle to get into.

00:08:37.720 --> 00:08:40.810
Please be serious about
making it to the top!

00:08:40.810 --> 00:08:43.600
F-Fine, jeez...

00:08:45.650 --> 00:08:47.020
Are you that worried?

00:08:47.020 --> 00:08:49.610
No, not exactly...

00:08:49.610 --> 00:08:53.280
Sumire-<i>san </i>has never been the center?

00:08:53.280 --> 00:08:56.530
She always talks about
how she wants to be up front,

00:08:56.530 --> 00:08:58.320
but when we actually
try to get her to do it,

00:08:58.320 --> 00:09:02.330
she tries to put it on me,
Chi-<i>chan</i>, or Keke-<i>chan</i>...

00:09:02.330 --> 00:09:04.660
Maybe she doesn't want to do it?

00:09:04.660 --> 00:09:09.840
She probably doesn't have the confidence
because of everything she's been through.

00:09:09.840 --> 00:09:13.300
But if the five of us really want to win,

00:09:13.300 --> 00:09:16.010
we all need to put our all into this,

00:09:16.010 --> 00:09:20.760
and be invested enough to be the center.

00:09:20.760 --> 00:09:23.520
So you should support her, too, Keke-<i>chan</i>.

00:09:23.520 --> 00:09:24.770
If she puts her all into this,

00:09:24.770 --> 00:09:28.860
I think Sumire-<i>chan </i>will show her
true potential and be unstoppable.

00:09:28.860 --> 00:09:30.480
Support...?

00:09:30.480 --> 00:09:33.320
Yeah. Despite how it seems,
I think it actually gets to her

00:09:33.320 --> 00:09:37.610
that she made you mad
when it comes to school idols.

00:09:47.080 --> 00:09:51.960
95, 96...

00:09:51.960 --> 00:09:56.590
...97, 98...

00:09:56.590 --> 00:10:01.180
...99, 100...

00:10:06.020 --> 00:10:09.690
How long are you going to practice, Sis?
It's time for dinner.

00:10:09.690 --> 00:10:11.480
You can go ahead and eat.

00:10:25.040 --> 00:10:26.330
The center...

00:10:26.330 --> 00:10:28.830
"Autumn School Arts Festival"

00:10:26.330 --> 00:10:28.830
Being a villager is a very important role.

00:10:28.830 --> 00:10:29.920
Being a villager is a very important role.

00:10:29.920 --> 00:10:30.830
I...

