00:10:44.510 --> 00:10:46.270
I'm...

00:10:49.190 --> 00:10:55.570
A-e-i-u-e-o-a-o! Ka-ke-ki-ku-ke-ko-ka-ko!

00:10:55.570 --> 00:11:01.910
Sa-se-shi-su-se-so-sa-so!
Ta-te-chi-tsu-te-to-ta-to!

00:11:04.280 --> 00:11:05.990
An outfit?

00:11:10.210 --> 00:11:11.920
What's going on?

00:11:11.920 --> 00:11:18.380
Making the outfits is my job,
so hurry up and put it on.

00:11:18.380 --> 00:11:20.130
This is mine?!

00:11:21.890 --> 00:11:25.010
You don't really have a presence,

00:11:25.010 --> 00:11:28.390
so I made yours stand out a bit more
so you have a chance as the center.

00:11:29.430 --> 00:11:32.060
Then let's have you
put that on and try singing.

00:11:32.060 --> 00:11:36.400
We were thinking about getting
the other students' opinions,

00:11:36.400 --> 00:11:38.610
so let's take a video
and have them look at it.

00:11:38.610 --> 00:11:42.200
Huh? But, I...

00:11:50.000 --> 00:11:51.710
You look great, Sumire-<i>chan</i>!

00:11:51.710 --> 00:11:53.540
You really do look lovely.

00:11:53.540 --> 00:11:55.250
Great job, Keke-<i>chan</i>.

00:11:55.250 --> 00:11:57.920
I-It's not like I did much...

00:11:58.920 --> 00:12:01.380
Well? Do you feel
a little more confident now?

00:12:03.090 --> 00:12:06.220
Okay, here we go. Music...

00:12:06.220 --> 00:12:07.760
