00:12:11.390 --> 00:12:13.980
<i>Love Live! Superstar!!</i>

00:12:15.940 --> 00:12:20.530
Hm... It'd be better if
Sumire-<i>chan </i>sang this part, too.

00:12:20.530 --> 00:12:21.610
Kanon-<i>chan</i>.

00:12:21.610 --> 00:12:24.360
Oh, morning. How'd the video turn out?

00:12:24.360 --> 00:12:26.870
Well, actually...

00:12:31.450 --> 00:12:33.580
