you might want to considering swapping."

00:13:05.280 --> 00:13:07.030
What do you think we should do?

00:13:07.030 --> 00:13:09.410
Isn't it obvious?

00:13:10.660 --> 00:13:12.080
Sumire-<i>chan</i>...

00:13:12.080 --> 00:13:14.500
We're school idols for this school,

00:13:14.500 --> 00:13:17.040
so we should obviously do what they want.

00:13:17.040 --> 00:13:18.040
But...

00:13:18.040 --> 00:13:19.170
I always thought it was weird

00:13:19.170 --> 00:13:21.760
to have someone like me
who's been in show business

00:13:21.760 --> 00:13:27.800
