an amateur contest like the Love Live.

00:13:27.800 --> 00:13:31.220
I'll wait for my turn at the finals.

00:13:32.180 --> 00:13:34.100
Sumire-<i>chan</i>, wait.

00:13:35.940 --> 00:13:37.600
Wha--

00:13:37.600 --> 00:13:40.820
Why are you running away?

00:13:40.820 --> 00:13:46.450
I'm against this. We already decided this,
so you should be the center!

00:13:46.450 --> 00:13:49.660
Did you not hear me?
I already made the outfits.

00:13:49.660 --> 00:13:53.450
It doesn't matter what anyone else says.
You should be the center.

00:13:53.450 --> 00:13:55.080
Keke-<i>chan</i>...

00:13:56.040 --> 00:13:58.170
I can't...

00:13:58.170 --> 00:14:00.250
You may say that, but I already know...

00:14:00.250 --> 00:14:02.920
In the end, it's never me!

00:14:02.920 --> 00:14:04.380
Sumire-<i>chan</i>!

00:14:19.810 --> 00:14:22.480
Sumire-<i>chan</i>'s not coming...

00:14:22.480 --> 00:14:23.690
Yeah.

00:14:25.360 --> 00:14:29.200
We really need to decide
what to do about the center.

00:14:29.200 --> 00:14:30.950
What do you think, Ren-chan?

00:14:30.950 --> 00:14:32.950
It's a difficult situation.

00:14:32.950 --> 00:14:36.960
Sumire-<i>san </i>is a very
skilled singer and dancer.

00:14:36.960 --> 00:14:41.040
But if I was asked if she was
the best in our group...

00:14:41.040 --> 00:14:42.630
Kanon-<i>chan </i>is the best singer.

00:14:42.630 --> 00:14:44.630
And the best dancer is Chi-<i>chan</i>.

00:14:44.630 --> 00:14:49.880
Ren-<i>chan </i>is the most elegant,
and Keke-<i>chan </i>shines the most.

00:14:49.880 --> 00:14:53.260
Sumire-<i>chan </i>has
all of these qualities, but...

00:14:53.260 --> 00:14:58.060
That's probably why her dreams
haven't come true yet.

00:14:58.060 --> 00:15:02.730
Yeah, and that's exactly why I think
that she should be the center.

00:15:02.730 --> 00:15:06.480
Because she has all of
the skills she needs.

00:15:11.110 --> 00:15:13.160
Hello, Sis?

00:15:14.740 --> 00:15:16.620
Yeah.

00:15:16.620 --> 00:15:19.290
I got a text from Dad.

00:15:19.290 --> 00:15:20.830
The Love Live?

00:15:20.830 --> 00:15:23.340
Yeah, it's coming up soon.

00:15:23.340 --> 00:15:26.880
We don't know the results yet.

00:15:26.880 --> 00:15:28.970
Yeah, I know.

00:15:28.970 --> 00:15:31.550
I remember that I promised
that if I don't make it,

00:15:31.550 --> 00:15:33.350
I'll come home.

00:15:33.350 --> 00:15:34.640
Go home?!

00:15:34.640 --> 00:15:38.730
Yeah. We're busy practicing
right now, so I'll let you go.

00:15:48.190 --> 00:15:49.900
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:15:49.900 --> 00:15:52.820
I guess we can start with the four of us.

00:15:52.820 --> 00:15:56.490
I'll try contacting
Sumire-<i>chan </i>again later.

00:15:59.160 --> 00:16:00.540
Sumire-chan.

00:16:06.420 --> 00:16:08.420
I guess I'm a little late.

00:16:08.420 --> 00:16:11.550
Is that really how you're
going to act as the center?

00:16:11.550 --> 00:16:13.840
I told you to take this seriously.

00:16:13.840 --> 00:16:15.100
The center?

00:16:15.100 --> 00:16:19.220
Yeah. We were just
talking about it, and...

00:16:19.220 --> 00:16:22.190
We still want you to be the center.

00:16:22.190 --> 00:16:23.190
But why?

00:16:23.190 --> 00:16:25.190
Why?

00:16:25.190 --> 00:16:27.320
Because you pity me?

00:16:27.320 --> 00:16:30.360
Even though no matter how hard I try,
I can never be the center?

00:16:30.360 --> 00:16:32.610
No. Kanon-<i>san </i>was just...

00:16:32.610 --> 00:16:35.530
What other possible reason is there?!

00:16:38.450 --> 00:16:42.330
I don't want to be the center out of pity.

00:16:42.330 --> 00:16:46.460
Everyone at school says that
someone else should be the center.

00:16:46.460 --> 00:16:47.540
Then...

00:16:47.540 --> 00:16:49.630
This isn't about pity!

00:16:50.550 --> 00:16:54.590
I would never make you
an outfit out of pity!

00:16:56.590 --> 00:16:58.470
You can have that outfit back.

00:16:58.470 --> 00:17:01.310
If you still insist on me
being the center,

00:17:01.310 --> 00:17:03.940
I'm going to quit being a school idol.

00:17:03.940 --> 00:17:05.230
But...

00:17:05.230 --> 00:17:09.070
Is that the extent of how you feel
about school idols?!

00:17:09.070 --> 00:17:12.490
Weren't you going to finally obtain
the spotlight at the Love Live?!

00:17:12.490 --> 00:17:14.900
We have to win, right?!

00:17:16.200 --> 00:17:20.580
You have to win this
no matter what, right?

00:17:22.830 --> 00:17:25.250
Wait...

00:17:25.250 --> 00:17:26.290
Sumire-<i>chan</i>!

00:17:26.290 --> 00:17:27.830
Wait!

00:17:31.920 --> 00:17:33.510
Wait!

00:17:35.590 --> 00:17:39.350
Just shut up already! We're done talking.

00:17:41.430 --> 00:17:45.850
You heard my conversation
on the phone, didn't you?

00:17:45.850 --> 00:17:49.520
It was wrong of you to eavesdrop.

00:17:49.520 --> 00:17:51.650
Do Kanon and the others know?

00:17:52.530 --> 00:17:54.610
--No.
--Why haven't you told them?

00:17:54.610 --> 00:17:58.660
Because I don't want them to be
school idols for my own sake.

00:17:58.660 --> 00:18:02.870
But we have to win, don't we?
We need to win! So--

00:18:02.870 --> 00:18:06.960
And that's exactly why
I want you to be the center!

00:18:06.960 --> 00:18:08.790
Why are you being so stubborn about this?

00:18:08.790 --> 00:18:10.630
It's not about being stubborn.

00:18:10.630 --> 00:18:12.000
But you are being stubborn.

00:18:12.000 --> 00:18:14.840
It's basically because it was Kanon's
idea. You didn't want me to do this.

00:18:14.840 --> 00:18:18.010
Or that you have no choice
since I'm practicing...

00:18:18.010 --> 00:18:20.390
Or that you pity me.

00:18:20.390 --> 00:18:23.010
You were watching
me practice, weren't you?

00:18:23.010 --> 00:18:26.140
I know everything there is about you!

00:18:26.140 --> 00:18:28.270
You don't understand a thing.

00:18:28.270 --> 00:18:31.770
Do you really think I can
let you be the center

00:18:31.770 --> 00:18:33.940
at my precious Love Live because of that?

00:18:33.940 --> 00:18:36.030
But you already did.

00:18:36.030 --> 00:18:41.240
I did that because I thought
you were worthy of that position.

00:18:42.280 --> 00:18:45.700
Watching you practice. Hearing you sing...

00:18:45.700 --> 00:18:49.250
I thought you were worthy of
being Liella!'s center.

00:18:49.250 --> 00:18:53.590
I know that you have what it takes.

00:18:55.630 --> 00:19:00.840
So just accept this already!
Just like how I put everything

00:19:00.840 --> 00:19:03.890
into making this for you.

00:19:06.810 --> 00:19:08.810
That's...

00:19:08.810 --> 00:19:09.940
Sumire-<i>chan</i>...

00:19:09.940 --> 00:19:12.770
I made this for you.

00:19:12.770 --> 00:19:15.690
Because you're our center.

00:19:27.910 --> 00:19:29.210
Hey!

00:19:30.080 --> 00:19:32.080
Wait!

00:19:35.750 --> 00:19:37.170
Please reach!

00:19:38.630 --> 00:19:40.220
Please reach!

00:19:45.310 --> 00:19:46.810
Sumire-<i>chan</i>!

00:19:48.350 --> 00:19:50.560
Ow...

00:19:50.560 --> 00:19:52.060
Jeez...

00:19:55.230 --> 00:19:56.900
Sumire...

00:20:00.280 --> 00:20:02.570
That's the first time
you actually said my name.

00:20:02.570 --> 00:20:05.160
That doesn't matter.

00:20:05.160 --> 00:20:09.080
Make sure you don't
embarrass us as Liella!'s center.

00:20:09.080 --> 00:20:13.580
Of course. Who do you
think you're talking to?

00:20:13.580 --> 00:20:18.420
Finally, the Yuigaoka school idols are
going to stand on the stage at Love Live.

00:20:18.420 --> 00:20:19.880
I'm so excited.

00:20:19.880 --> 00:20:20.880
Yeah.

00:20:20.880 --> 00:20:25.350
We're actually connecting with
a lot of other school idols...

00:20:25.350 --> 00:20:27.010
...and our voices will resonate.

00:20:27.010 --> 00:20:29.600
Galaxy!

00:20:47.740 --> 00:20:49.660
♬ Hey, but I want to smile more ♬

00:20:49.660 --> 00:20:51.870
♬ But I want to be more honest ♬

00:20:51.870 --> 00:20:53.830
♬ Hey, but I want to shine right now ♬

00:20:53.830 --> 00:20:56.000
♬ Let's stop those feelings right here ♬

00:20:56.000 --> 00:20:57.960
♬ Hey, let's stop complaining ♬

00:20:57.960 --> 00:21:00.130
♬ I'll shine down on you immediately ♬

00:21:00.130 --> 00:21:02.510
♬ Once I grab ahold of your hand ♬

00:21:02.510 --> 00:21:04.680
♬ I'll never let go of it ♬

00:21:04.680 --> 00:21:08.390
♬ I'll prove to you ♬

00:21:08.390 --> 00:21:13.140
♬ That nothing is impossible ♬

00:21:13.140 --> 00:21:16.730
♬ I'll crack that poker face of yours ♬

00:21:16.730 --> 00:21:20.860
♬ I'm going to make you mine ♬

00:21:22.650 --> 00:21:23.150
♬ Let's sing ♬

00:21:23.150 --> 00:21:27.370
♬ I'll take you to a world
that you've never seen before ♬

00:21:27.370 --> 00:21:31.700
♬ You're about to see
a fantastic wonderland ♬

00:21:31.700 --> 00:21:36.370
♬ Fantastic! Amazing!
But this is nonfiction!! ♬

00:21:36.370 --> 00:21:40.000
♬ Let's open this new door ♬

00:21:40.000 --> 00:21:41.550
♬ Do Da Da Follow me ♬

00:21:41.550 --> 00:21:44.090
♬ Do Da Da Real Live Yeah! ♬

00:21:44.090 --> 00:21:45.680
♬ Do Da Da Follow me ♬

00:21:45.680 --> 00:21:48.220
♬ Do Da Da Love me do! ♬

00:21:48.220 --> 00:21:49.800
♬ Do Da Da Follow me ♬

00:21:49.800 --> 00:21:52.350
♬ Do Da Da Real Live Yeah! ♬

00:21:52.350 --> 00:21:53.980
♬ Do Da Da Follow me ♬

00:21:53.980 --> 00:21:56.190
♬ Do Da Da Love me do! ♬

00:22:13.240 --> 00:22:16.330
Thanks, Keke.

00:22:16.330 --> 00:22:17.830
Sumire...

00:22:19.330 --> 00:22:22.250
Hey, what are you...

00:22:25.340 --> 00:22:28.930
<i>The future is calling to us</i>

00:22:28.930 --> 00:22:31.760
<i>Like the wind</i>

00:22:31.760 --> 00:22:37.980
<i>No one knows what the future holds for us</i>

00:22:39.400 --> 00:22:42.320
<i>Even then, we want to move forward</i>

00:22:42.320 --> 00:22:45.820
<i>Because we don't want to have any regrets</i>

00:22:45.820 --> 00:22:49.450
<i>You can't hold down our hearts</i>

00:22:49.450 --> 00:22:53.620
<i>Let's all be free</i>

00:22:53.620 --> 00:22:57.080
<i>We're not going to give up!</i>

00:22:57.080 --> 00:23:00.670
<i>Because we decided that</i>

00:23:00.670 --> 00:23:03.710
<i>We'll cry, laugh, and do our best</i>

00:23:03.710 --> 00:23:08.050
<i>We all want to surpass our limits</i>

00:23:08.050 --> 00:23:12.300
<i>It's important to believe</i>

00:23:12.300 --> 00:23:15.850
<i>And once we told ourselves that</i>

00:23:15.850 --> 00:23:22.860
<i>Let's try to go even further</i>

00:23:22.860 --> 00:23:30.610
<i>We may be small, but we have big dreams</i>

00:23:30.610 --> 00:23:37.700
<i>We won't give in, now, let's fly together</i>

00:23:37.700 --> 00:23:45.300
<i>Let's fly the best we can,</i>
<i>now, let's fly together</i>

00:23:47.090 --> 00:23:50.680
Next time, "Once More, at That Place."
